# Player commit: only the Release exe and Assets are tracked.
# Everything else is ignored, including source and dependencies. Collaborators
# download the dependencies separately, from the list kept outside the repo.
*

# Keep this file itself.
!.gitignore

# Game assets.
!Assets/
!Assets/**

# The Release build a player runs. Ignore its debug symbols and other outputs.
!Build/
!Build/x64/
!Build/x64/Release/
!Build/x64/Release/bin/
!Build/x64/Release/bin/RPG-I.exe
